  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of the pvNugs Kafka messaging provider for .NET 10.\n            Provides Kafka producer, consumer, typed consumer, and monitoring\n            implementations for the pvNugs messaging abstractions.\n            Supports explicit consumer groups, explicit offset commits,\n            configurable PLAINTEXT, SASL_PLAINTEXT and SASL_SSL security modes,\n            secret-manager-based credential resolution, dummy mode, and modular\n            dependency injection.",
